# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real keys.
#
# The app runs fully on bundled sample data with none of these set.

# --- Option A: direct browser calls (local demo only) -------------------------
# Anything prefixed with VITE_ is inlined into the JavaScript bundle at build
# time and is therefore PUBLIC. Use a throwaway free key here, never a paid one,
# and never for a deployment you share.
# Free key: https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key
# Free tier: 25 requests/day, end-of-day data. Educational projects can request
# an unlimited daily quota on the same page.
VITE_ALPHAVANTAGE_KEY=

# --- Option B: backend proxy (recommended for anything shared) ----------------
# Point this at a serverless function that holds the real key server-side and
# forwards the request. See "Keeping the key off the client" in the README.
VITE_API_PROXY_URL=
